tpm-keyring-unlock (1.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Packaging support: make install with DESTDIR/PREFIX/PAMDIR, the
    tpm-keyring-seal and tpm-keyring-unlock-configure commands, and a
    --no-build mode so the configure step leaves packaged files alone.

